## Log Recovery & Tracking

### Regain CLI Container Logs Midway
If you lose your active terminal session during a run, fetch the live container streams with:
```bash
docker compose logs -f
```

### Open the Pipeline Application Logs
To monitor the internal script processing details in real time:
```bash
tail -f logs/pipeline.log
```

